# Possessions

## Boox Note Air4 C

E-ink tablet with color display for reading and note-taking.

### Cheatsheet: Factory Reset

Hold the power button for 10 seconds until the device powers off completely. Then hold power button for another 5 seconds while holding the volume up button to enter recovery mode. Select "Wipe data/factory reset" using volume buttons and confirm with power button.

### Cheatsheet: Export Notes

1. Open the Notes app
2. Select the note you want to export
3. Tap the three-dot menu in the top right
4. Choose "Export as PDF" or "Export as PNG"
5. Select the destination folder (local storage or cloud)
6. Confirm the export

### Cheatsheet: Update Firmware

1. Go to Settings > About
2. Tap "System Update"
3. If an update is available, tap "Download"
4. Once downloaded, tap "Install"
5. Device will reboot and install the update
6. Do not power off during the update process

### Cheatsheet: Screen Calibration

1. Navigate to Settings > Display
2. Tap on "Color Calibration"
3. Follow the on-screen instructions
4. Adjust RGB sliders to your preference
5. Tap "Apply" to save changes
6. Restart the device for best results

## Shokz Opencomm

Bone conduction headphones for all-day wear with boom microphone.

### Cheatsheet: Pairing Mode

1. Turn off the headphones
2. Press and hold the volume+ button for 5-7 seconds
3. LED will flash red and blue alternately
4. Headphones are now in pairing mode
5. Search for "Shokz OpenComm" on your device
6. Select to connect

### Cheatsheet: Multipoint Connection

1. Connect to the first device as normal
2. Turn off Bluetooth on the first device
3. Enter pairing mode again
4. Connect to the second device
5. Turn on Bluetooth on the first device
6. Both devices are now connected

### Cheatsheet: Firmware Update

1. Download the Shokz app on your smartphone
2. Connect your OpenComm to the app
3. Check for firmware updates in the app
4. Tap "Update" if available
5. Keep headphones near phone during update
6. Do not use headphones until update completes

### Cheatsheet: Charge Time Optimization

1. Use the included magnetic charging cable
2. Ensure charging contacts are clean and aligned
3. Full charge takes approximately 1 hour
4. A 5-minute quick charge provides 2 hours of talk time
5. Battery life: up to 16 hours of talk time
6. Standby time: up to 14 days
